{
 "rules": {
  "f_decode": "A1 O1: on training-split wells (the decoder training fields), ridge on the standardised raw tile-mean latent, alpha by inner CV over 10^-1..10^5, R^2 of pooled held-out predictions from 5-fold GroupKFold over plates (as in the D0 pilot); idr0119 log count >= 0.8 and G1 fraction >= 0.5; idr0064 Erk C/N >= 0.5. The provisional vehicle value is reported beside. A failure drops that set's decoded readouts (and for idr0119 the ODE comparisons) only.",
  "f_dose": "Per drug x line, over its training-split doses (lowest and training interior doses; wells train and train_sel): displacement = Euclidean norm of the condition's mean normalised latent (fields, tiles and replicate wells averaged) at the 48 h clip minus the line's vehicle mean at that clip; Spearman rho of displacement vs dose. Pass if rho >= 0.6 for >= 50% of drug x line pairs. Vehicle is not a point (its displacement from itself is not a dose response); the variant with vehicle as dose 0 is reported beside.",
  "f_power": "From the frozen split: H1 test held-out-dose conditions >= 20 (interior test plus test extrapolation), H2a test combination conditions >= 6, H2b test compounds >= 60. A shortfall drops that hypothesis before training."
 },
